    "human_role": "Human asked for a separate new scheme while preserving the published Finite Water City; prioritised housing and public life; delegated node choice; required English-only public material and A/B/C node IDs without old-code aliases. On 27 October 2026 the human reviewed the new concept and explicitly requested pushing it and showing it on the homepage. Public preview publication is authorised; official competition dates remain unpublished."
